<code>assert \result.length == this.size();</code>

It seems there was a misunderstanding in the initial interpretation of the comment. The comment states "The returned array length is one greater than the collection size," but the actual behavior of the `toArray()` method is to return an array with a length equal to the size of the collection. Therefore, the correct assert statement should reflect that the length of the returned array is equal to the size of the collection.
--------------------
<code>assert \result.length == this.size();</code>
